#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""cobdev - drive the Cobblify UI dev client from an agent session.

The dev client runs in the user's own macOS account (bin/start.sh in /Users/Shared/cobblify-dev)
because the agent account cannot open windows. cobdev stages the game files where that account can
read them and talks to the in-game control API on 127.0.0.1. See tools/devloop/README.md.
"""
